Or a pet.

In addition to throwing them in, for unbreakables, you can kick
them in, several ways, from inside on the free grid square by
stepping back into the doorway, or from the doorway by stepping
out in the hall, or even from the hall if the geometry is right.

Or if you really have a lot of time to kill, you can let your pet
carry them in and drop them; this I think would be mostly a way
to pass the time in an extinctionist game.

